commit cbe074c11c244140af9d82d505821cbbb60ad37c
Author: matiasrodriguezc01 <matiasrodriguezc01@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Nov 15 22:32:01 2026 -0300

    Fix evaluator defects in conversation history
    
    - Load failure clears stale conversation/counts; error shown above composer
    - Malformed history entries skipped per entry (WARN), kept on disk
    - Corrupt/non-list history and write failures give user-facing messages with file path
    - Citations reveal, scroll to, focus and highlight the cited chunk; 1-based chunk numbers
    - Answers to questions pending during a clear are discarded (service + renderer)
    - role=log moved to a wrapper so the <ol> keeps list semantics
    - Cancel/Esc on Clear confirmation returns focus to 'Clear conversation'
    - Follow-ups use the ancestor chain; retrieval ignores stop words/punctuation
    - Excerpts plain-text and clamped; long answers cut on word boundary
    - Remove dead qa:history API; shared styles module; midnight timestamp refresh
    - Tests 20/20, E2E 34/34, evaluator probe 12/13 (P9b known false positive)

